 rformance. Want to use a gift card? Please email \, call ([contact removed]
 )\, or visit the Box Office to redeem.\n\nABOUT THE COMEDIAN\n\nKendall Far
 rell is a New York City based standup comedian from Vermont. In his home st
 ate Kendall won the Vermont’s Funniest Comedian Contest and was profiled 
 in Seven Days for his work. In New York\, Kendall has performed on some of 
 the most acclaimed shows in the city including at Comedians You Should Know
 \, Gotham Comedy Club\, and the Upright Citizens Brigade.\n\nHe was named a
  ‘Comic To Watch’ at the New York Comedy Festival and headlined Carolin
 e’s on Broadway as part of their Breakout Artist series. He has been hear
 d on SiriusXM as well as seen on Cracked\, Adult Swim\, and at comedy festi
 vals across the country.\n\nHe regularly opens for national headliners incl
 uding Michelle Wolf\, Rachel Feinstein\, Beth Stelling\, Ashley Gavin\, Dre
 w Lynch\, Matteo Lane & more.\n\nAGES : ALL (18+ recommended)\nDOORS : 30 m
 ins before early shows\; 15 mins before late show s\n(Come early and have a
  drink in the lounge!)\n\nVisiting from out of town? Stay upstairs at the H
 ilton Garden Inn!\nClick here for a 15% discount off the regular hotel rate
 .\n\nSUPPORT COMEDY IN VERMONT! Our Patreon members get free tickets\, earl
 y access and more. Or donate to our 501(c)(3) nonprofit\, Vermont Comedy Ar
 ts \, which is dedicated to making comedy education\, performance and commu
 nity accessible to all.\n\n*** COVID-19 PROTOCOL INFO ***\n\nTo learn about
